# main

A module whose name a `use` can spell, `main` here, is called through the
binding `use main` makes, its labels the checker's (spec § 1, § 9; panel
253's R2).

## function between

    function between(left: str, right: str, inner: str) -> str

The text between two others.

- `left`: what opens it
- `right`: what closes it
- `inner`: what stands between

    main.between(left: left, right: right, inner: inner)
